.TH MAINUAN-GESTAO-DRIVERS 1 "October 2026" "Mainuan 0.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mainuan-gestao-drivers \- detect hardware drivers and preview planned changes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mainuan-gestao-drivers
.RI [ test ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lists additional drivers using the shared driver detection backend.
Driver selections produce a read-only preview of planned package changes.
This is the official Qt6 interface of Mainuan Gestao de Drivers, beta 0.1.
The interface does not install or remove driver packages.
PackageKit execution is not enabled in this frontend.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B test
Include fictitious devices for inspecting driver choices and plan previews.
Fictitious plans cannot be executed.
